    "description": {
      "value": "As a mortal, Jukha was a charismatic young dromaar with great ambitions of uniting her people to defeat Tar-Baphon. Ultimately failing to keep her followers together, the ambitious youth perished alone but managed to ascend, transforming into a goddess of big game hunting. Having learned from her mistakes, Jukha emphasizes the need to band together to accomplish one's goals."
    },
